        end: Last frame to fit over. Short form e.
        step: Frames between samples. Short form by. Default 1.
        strength: How far toward the fit. Short form st. Default 1.0.
        regularize: Pull toward the current weights; higher keeps more of what is painted. Short form rg. Default 0.05.
        smoothIterations: pose: smoothing passes of the delta mush. Short form si. Default 10.
        simIterations: simulate: solver passes. Short form ni. Default 40.
        contact: simulate: keep folds from passing through themselves. Short form ct. Default True.
        vertices: Point ids; defaults to the selected vertices, else all. Short form v.
    """

