        inWhite: levels: input white point. Default 1.0.
        gamma: levels: midtone gamma; above 1 brightens. Default 1.0.
        outBlack: levels: output black. Default 0.0.
        outWhite: levels: output white. Default 1.0.
        channels: Channels to change: some of r, g, b, a. Default 'rgba'.
